      <slug></slug>
      <title>A talk on FLOSSMetrics</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>CrossDesktop</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk would introduce the &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.flossmetrics.org/&#34;&gt;FLOSSMetrics project&lt;/a&gt;, its aims and initial findings.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The main objective of FLOSSMETRICS is to construct, publish and analyse a large scale database with information and metrics about libre software development coming from several thousands of software projects, using existing methodologies, and tools already developed.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="2851">Jesus M. Gonzalez Barahona</person>
      </persons>
